     4080       for each  ll-tmp#zakaz  where ll-tmp#zakaz.doc-code = loc-ord-num and
     4081                                     ll-tmp#zakaz.gds-code <> goods.gds-code :
     4082           if max-num < ll-tmp#zakaz.line-num then
